CTS: Component Technical Requirements
SF: 1. Safety Goals/Safety States
SF: 2. FuSa Requirements (FSR)
SCR: Software Component Requirements
HMX: Human Machine Expirience Requirements
FuSa: Technical Safety Requiremens
FIGMA: UI Design Representation
